t":"日本語が上手で違和感がなかった","ts":"1632901140.190700","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"wakaru","count":1,"users":["U01BY3SDBRS"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"SCdi"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3653cf50-5ee9-4fd6-bc40-2dba9f448bbd","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"（本人なの気付いてなかった）","ts":"1632900766.190500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Wqr"}]},{"client_msg_id":"bd3b23b1-7783-4815-aeb2-67477a68e583","type":"message","user":"U7TMPGWJ0","text":"`lukas-reineke/indent-blankline.nvim` に乗り換えました","ts":"1632899420.189600","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"me-too","count":1,"users":["U01G63H9VN3"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"93OEL"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e9a2bd47-27b1-4254-bcfd-4ead64a66eb6","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"本人が日本語で降臨されている？！","ts":"1632899319.189300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"GT6"}]},{"client_msg_id":"fdc5417e-b54f-4271-97d0-36bb3a3b67c7","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"（お勧め設定が知りたい）","ts":"1632898641.188600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"KGe"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f79f60ef-446a-4a2b-a947-e55f115fe948","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"お、もう入ったんですね","ts":"1632898637.188300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"cnbAS"}]},{"client_msg_id":"38E80959-7183-48EC-958C-B4052A6F834C","type":"message","user":"U02GD5GRJ72","text":"本当に感謝です！","ts":"1632896519.188000","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"tada","count":1,"users":["UDUB0U5GV"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"2Cjh"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5c825da2-5b5c-4772-b152-9dcf82b59956","type":"message","user":"UDUB0U5GV","text":"これからどっちも出来ます\n`indent_blankline_context_highlight_list` = indent level\n`indent_blankline_context_pattern_highlight` = context pattern","ts":"1632896490.187500","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"benri","count":4,"users":["U7TMPGWJ0","U8R597E9H","U01BY3SDBRS","UDSCCB2M9"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"i1NS6"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4031E16A-D3E5-4736-8A3E-3682B8AEC3CC","type":"message","user":"U02GD5GRJ72","text":"なるほど、今まではインデントのレベルによって色が変えられてただけだったのか\nてっきり、コンテキストの種類で色分けをしているのかと勘違いしていました\n\n勘違いだったとは言えアイデアを形にしてくれてありがとうございます！","ts":"1632895510.186300","edited":{"user":"U02GD5GRJ72","ts":"1632895590.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Fwq1c"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a90b5bc5-b640-4abb-9c76-554ff4a8ef8e","type":"message","user":"UDUB0U5GV","text":":arrow_up: やてみた\n\u003chttps://github.com/lukas-reineke/indent-blankline.nvim/pull/244\u003e","ts":"1632894525.183400","attachments":[{"color":"36a64f","fallback":"\u003chttps://github.com/lukas-reineke/indent-blankline.nvim/pull/244|#244 feature: add context-pattern-highlight\u003e","id":1,"title":"\u003chttps://github.com/lukas-reineke/indent-blankline.nvim/pull/244|#244 feature: add context-pattern-highlight\u003e","text":"Adds `g:indent_blankline_context_pattern_highlight` option.  \nIt specifies a map of patterns set in `g:indent_blankline_context_patterns` to highlight groups.  \nWhen the current matching context pattern is in the map, the context will be highlighted with the corresponding highlight group.\n\nEmpty by default\n\nThank you Gen.F for the idea :pray:","mrkdwn_in":["text"],"blocks":null,"footer":"\u003chttps://github.com/lukas-reineke/indent-blankline.nvim|lukas-reineke/indent-blankline.nvim\u003e","footer_icon":"https://slack.github.com/static/img/favicon-neutral.png","ts":1632894479}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"sugoi","count":3,"users":["U7TMPGWJ0","U01BY3SDBRS","UDSCCB2M9"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"EzRW5"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1fbdd226-65b9-4ce7-91d7-1a497703e49a","type":"message","user":"UDUB0U5GV","text":"\u0026gt; コンテキストの種類によって、色を分けることもできるのか\nいいイデア！\n今indent levelによってだけ出来ます。contextによってを追加するはそんな難しくないと思います。","ts":"1632892717.182900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"jLee0"}]},{"client_msg_id":"fd6a5b15-0c11-4409-bc15-061175b28b31","type":"message","user":"UDUB0U5GV","text":"\u0026gt;  カーソル位置からネストのコンテキストを計算した方がいいかなと思い\nですね。自分もそうと思ったけど、ちょっと難しかった。treesitter使うならめちゃくちゃ簡単なのでそれにしました。\nコントリビュートチャンいつでもよろしくお願いします:bow:\n\ndeefault treesitter context patternもけっこ悩んでた。自分今これ使ってます\n\n```\"class\",\n\"function\",\n\"method\",\n\"^if\",\n\"while\",\n\"for\",\n\"with\",\n\"func_literal\",\n\"block\",\n\"try\",\n\"except\",\n\"argument_list\",\n\"object\",\n\"dictionary\",\n\"element\"```","ts":"1632891008.180200","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"goodpoem","count":1,"users":["U02GD5GRJ72"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Y/=w7"}]},{"client_msg_id":"900a770a-238c-4490-a0d7-eac8fe2a4de5","type":"message","user":"U01BVGM8K63","text":"できますよー","ts":"1632884206.176100","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"subara","count":1,"users":["U02GD5GRJ72"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"6hY"}]},{"client_msg_id":"29fac81b-80f4-40c2-bba7-0f74d6f9fa06","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"おそらくできるんじゃないかと思います、やってる人いないのかな","ts":"1632876996.175800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"u76kl"}]},{"client_msg_id":"615079f5-3c00-40fa-bd65-8c9d3034c0dc","type":"message","user":"U02GD5GRJ72","text":"なるほど、\n僕はpackerに惚れてしまったのですが、denops とかもpackerで使えますか？","ts":"1632876446.175500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"jSH"}]},{"client_msg_id":"779c780a-f0d9-4b21-abf1-156cbe02b069","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"どうせならdenopsでTS使えるようになったのでvim-jp的にもそっちでやりたい気持ちが","ts":"1632876396.174800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"vYI"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f8e9393d-c322-4dcd-9e0e-235abc4c3f8c","type":"message","user":"U02GD5GRJ72","text":"それはそうですね！","ts":"1632876280.174200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"7L3A"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2f35364e-8c2d-48bd-8dca-3c8b93c5fe01","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"あとはまぁ自分で作れば好きにカスタマイズできるので！","ts":"1632876257.173800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"IOGU"}]},{"client_msg_id":"218c027e-2a36-4be0-ba71-25007968778c","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"```const obj = {\n  a: {\n    b: {\n      c: {\n        d: 1,\n      },\n    },\n  },\n};```\nとか、コンテキストが変わらなさそうなオブジェクトを書く場合ちゃんとコンテキスト読んでくれるのかなぁ","ts":"1632876024.173300","edited":{"user":"U8996GYBF","ts":"1632876062.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"4QwcL"}]},{"client_msg_id":"104fc34c-53f6-4348-b3d6-0176e485358f","type":"message","user":"U02GD5GRJ72","text":"参考までに、設定を書いておきます","ts":"1632875845.172200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"l=WDB"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c2bc34e9-9d41-4d17-8391-5a616a296fd8","type":"message","user":"U02GD5GRJ72","text":"```function M.indent_blankline()\n  vim.cmd [[autocmd FileType * highlight IndentBlanklineIndent1 guifg=#666666 blend=nocombine]]\n  vim.cmd [[autocmd FileType * highlight IndentBlanklineIndent2 guifg=#333333 blend=nocombine]]\n\n  vim.cmd [[autocmd FileType * highlight IndentBlanklineContext guifg=#4444aa blend=nocombine]]\n  vim.cmd [[autocmd FileType * highlight IndentBlanklineContext2 guifg=#ff4400 blend=nocombine]]\n\n  vim.g.indentLine_fileTypeExclude = {'dashboard', 'markdown'}\n  vim.g.indent_blankline_use_treesitter = true\n  vim.g.indent_blankline_show_current_context = true\n  vim.g.indent_blankline_context_patterns = {'if', 'class', 'function', 'method', 'for'}\n  vim.g.indent_blankline_context_highlight_list = {\n    \"IndentBlanklineContext\",\n    \"indentblanklinecontext\",\n    \"indentblanklinecontext\",\n    \"IndentBlanklineContext\",\n    \"IndentBlanklineContext\",\n  }\n\n  require(\"indent_blankline\").setup {\n    buftype_exclude = {\"dashboard\", \"markdown\"},\n    space_char_blankline = \" \",\n    char = '▏', -- '▏', '┊', '│', '⎸'\n    char_highlight_list = {\n      \"IndentBlanklineIndent1\",\n      \"IndentBlanklineIndent2\",\n      \"IndentBlanklineIndent1\",\n      \"IndentBlanklineIndent2\",\n      \"IndentBlanklineIndent1\",\n      \"IndentBlanklineIndent2\",\n      \"IndentBlanklineIndent1\",\n      \"IndentBlanklineIndent2\",\n      \"IndentBlanklineIndent1\",\n      \"IndentBlanklineIndent2\",\n    }\n  }\nend```","ts":"1632875835.171800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Q+x+J"}]},{"client_msg_id":"148b6c64-85f0-4c9e-a05f-6918a1548a4a","type":"message","user":"U02GD5GRJ72","text":"言語の問題ですかね","ts":"1632875822.171300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"=qYA"}]},{"client_msg_id":"919e60d8-18b3-4aba-9bde-e2a5345a22ed","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"いや、自分が貼ったのは今試したんですよね","ts":"1632875795.170900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"9VEda"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c498135c-2784-4d5b-a68b-4fa1464696ed","type":"message","user":"U02GD5GRJ7